Folo AI Passport XiaoZhi

This repository is derived from xiaozhi-esp32:
https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32

Upstream snapshot used for this port:
- Version: 2.4.2
- Commit: bb9122ab08c3083eeb4f67b3974b7afe771723b8

The upstream project is licensed under the MIT License. The original license
and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.

Badge-specific modifications include the folo-ai-passport-c3 board identity,
ESP32-C3 pin mapping, ST7789P3 panel initialization, ES8311 audio wiring,
GPIO0 ADC ladder buttons, 8 MB build configuration, Windows build launcher
compatibility, and single-board repository/CI packaging.

